    recommendSolutions();
    console.log("For more help, visit: https://support.microsoft.com/");
  } else {
    console.log("Your system seems to be running smoothly.");
  }
}

// Run the check
checkSystemPerformance();
```

---

## 🧠 Optional Enhancements (Advanced)

If you're building a **desktop application** using **Electron**, **Node.js**, or a **backend service with system access**, you could perform more advanced checks (e.g., using `systeminformation` or `psutil` libraries). But for web-based JavaScript, you're limited to browser APIs.

